#!name=大蓝树自动签到 (自建重构版)
#!desc=大蓝树每日自动签到，包含获取Token与定时任务。
#!author=liukaiqiao
#!icon=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png

[Script]

1. 获取 Token (已修正参数顺序，并关闭 requires-body 防止 GET 请求漏抓)

http-request ^https?://dalanshu.top/api/v1/me/checkin/status script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/Scripts/cookie/get_cookie.js, requires-body=false, timeout=20, tag=大蓝树每日签到Token, img-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png

2. 定时签到 (已指向你个人仓库的 dalanshu.js)

cron "30 8 * * *" script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liukaiqiao/Loon-Rules/refs/heads/main/Task/dalanshu.js, timeout=60, tag=大蓝树每日签到, img-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/main/icons/apps/dalanshu.png

[Mitm]
hostname = dalanshu.top
